    return `<section class="career-interview-replay" data-career-answer-replay="${e(key)}"><div class="section-heading"><div><h3>这道题，我回答过 ${attempts.length} 次</h3><p class="career-replay-question">${e(question)}</p><p class="form-note">选择两次原回答，连同当时反馈和引用一起看。新旧顺序、字数或语气都不能证明理解进步，模拟回答也不证明做过项目。</p></div><a class="text-button" href="#career/${e(data.id)}/replay/${e(source.step_id)}/${index}">定位这道题的全部回答 ↗</a></div>${attempts.length>1?`<div class="form-grid">${pair.map((row,side)=>`<label>${side===0?"左侧回答":"右侧回答"}<select data-career-answer-pair="${e(key)}" data-answer-side="${side}">${attempts.map((item,n)=>`<option value="${e(item.step_id)}" ${item===row?"selected":""}>第 ${n+1} 次 · ${e(when(item.created_at))}${!discussionAvailable(item)?" · 反馈不可用于继续研究":""}</option>`).join("")}</select></label>`).join("")}</div><div class="career-answer-comparison">${pair.map((row,n)=>answerReplayColumn(row,n)).join("")}</div><div class="result-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary small" data-career-compare-answers="${e(key)}" ${valid?"":"disabled"}>准备对照这两次回答，再追问 ↗</button><button type="button" class="text-button" data-career-export-answers="${e(key)}">导出这两次回答与反馈 ↧</button></div><p class="form-note">对照与导出不调用模型；准备追问后，仍可修改问题，再决定是否开始研究。</p>`:""}<details class="career-answer-history" data-career-answer-history="${e(key)}" ${attempts.length===1||saved?.history_open?"open":""}><summary>全部回答记录 · ${attempts.length} 次</summary>${attempts.map((row,n)=>`<details class="panel career-attempt" ${attempts.length===1?"open":""}><summary>第 ${n+1} 次回答 · ${e(when(row.created_at))}</summary>${answerReplayColumn(row,null)}</details>`).join("")}</details></section>`;
