    return `<details class="career-library-claims"><summary>命中的 ${row.claim_match_count} 条判断 · 回看完整原句</summary><p class="form-note">检索词出现在以下原句中；它们是当时的分析，需结合引用与适用条件核对。</p>${row.claim_matches.map(claim=>`<article><p class="form-note">第 ${claim.index+1} 条 · ${e(categoryLabels[claim.category]||claim.category||"研究判断")} · ${e(claimBasisLabel(claim))} · ${e(requirementLabels[claim.requirement]||"要求性质未说明")}</p><p>${e(claim.text)}</p>${claim.source_titles?.length?`<p class="form-note">当时引用：${claim.source_titles.map(e).join("、")}</p>`:""}<div class="result-actions"><a class="text-button" href="#career/${e(row.project_id)}/discussion/${e(row.step_id)}/${claim.index}">回到第 ${claim.index+1} 条与引用 ↗</a>${discussionAvailable(source)?`<button type="button" class="secondary small" data-career-check-claim="${e(row.step_id)}:${claim.index}">准备查证这条判断 ↗</button>`:""}</div></article>`).join("")}${row.claim_match_count>row.claim_matches.length?`<p class="form-note">先展示 ${row.claim_matches.length} 条完整判断，其余 ${row.claim_match_count-row.claim_matches.length} 条可回到整份研究查看。</p>`:""}</details>`;
